# N2e.clean: e1m6's corridor at exact perspective, every pixel divided, plain.
# `r_perspspan 1`, turning from yaw 74.7 to 99.3 over the file, the divide rig's second
# pass, plain: slop at 1920x1080, no status bar. The film's PER6.
#
# Under V4-47: "And that's the slop preset, switched on." Its "on" is the cut to HERO.

map e1m6

duration 19.2
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar r_perspspan 1
cvar gamma 0.8

camera path
key 0     504,500,242  0,74.7209  ease linear
key 19.2  504,500,242  0,99.2791

sound on
events on
